  "self_review": [
    "Windows split the whole original JSON at UTF8 boundaries, not individual fields. Reassembly, byte offsets and a full projection digest precede JSON parsing; no field truncation was added.",
    "Snapshot and cursor tokens use a process-private HMAC key and immutable random snapshot identity. Scope hashes exact Current User/Core/binding/captured origins; paths and native addresses are not token parameters.",
    "Only already verified child identities can mint descendant tokens; wrong token kind, extra fields, unsupported signature, other snapshot, invalid UTF8 offset and scope changes fail closed. Derived child status is unknown/nonlive.",
    "This private object is not a fresh Core grant. Every later window/descendant operation must re-resolve the original Core reference, and the future registry must hold read slots until workers exit and dispose cancelled snapshots.",
    "Initial discovery/hash and full Grok parent decode now receive the same stop flag. Shared verified record decoder reused; cancellation propagates instead of becoming an advisory fallback.",
    "Review caught that std Write::write_all retries Interrupted forever. Serialization cancellation uses terminal Other error; after-stop zero-append is tested without scheduling or a model.",
    "Source hash uses existing immutable documents; complete output is still resident memory, not claimed a disk-spooled or bounded-total-memory registry. Only each transport window has a byte bound.",
    "Fixed Coaxi parser bodies/stats/common functions and dependency/database/model-input files remain unchanged. The prior31 component differential is retained with its original qualification, not rerun or called a full App comparison.",
    "One existing filesystem owner extends its same owned directory. Precancellation and serialization stop are deterministic; this batch does not claim an actual concurrent background close or Runtime shutdown."
  ],
